  "description": "Turn up the volume on your next project with this electrifying Neon Pop Party Pattern Bundle! Packed with 20 seamless repeat patterns, this high-energy collection bursts with 90s-inspired icons like smiley faces, skulls, lightning bolts, pizza slices, cocktails, stars, and music notes — all splashed in vibrant neon pink, blue, yellow, and lime green.\nPerfect for party invitations, sublimation, digital paper, teen crafts, sticker designs, and bold apparel prints, these seamless designs are made for maximum impact. Whether you’re creating a retro rave look or playful pop art, this pack delivers nonstop color and fun.\n⚡ What’s Included:\n⭐ 20 seamless patterns\n⭐ High-resolution JPGs (4000×4000 px, 300 DPI)\n⭐ Bonus Photoshop .PAT file for instant application\nLet your creativity go wild with this bold and bubbly pattern explosion! 💥🎶🍕💀",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Turn up the volume on your next project with this electrifying Neon Pop Party Pattern Bundle! Packed with 20 seamless repeat patterns, this high-energy collection bursts with 90s-inspired icons like smiley faces, skulls, lightning bolts, pizza slices, cocktails, stars, and music notes — all splashed in vibrant neon pink, blue, yellow, and lime green.</p>\n<p>Perfect for party invitations, sublimation, digital paper, teen crafts, sticker designs, and bold apparel prints, these seamless designs are made for maximum impact. Whether you’re creating a retro rave look or playful pop art, this pack delivers nonstop color and fun.</p>\n<p>⚡ What’s Included:<br>\n⭐ 20 seamless patterns<br>\n⭐ High-resolution JPGs (4000×4000 px, 300 DPI)<br>\n⭐ Bonus Photoshop .PAT file for instant application</p>\n<p>Let your creativity go wild with this bold and bubbly pattern explosion! 💥🎶🍕💀</p>",
